{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-q-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Luxe Q Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso LUXE Q Pod System, featuring a 1000mAh battery, draw-activated firing mechanism, and can hold up to 2mL within the pod. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the LUXE Q Pod System is impervious to light falls and drops. Wrapped in a leather-textured coating, the chassis is anti-slip and anti-sweat. Maintaining a diminutive size, the LUXE Q Pod System is about the same length as a credit card, making it easy to conceal and bring about. Outfitted with a 2mL refillable pod with integrated coil options, the Vaporesso LUXE Q offers a 0.8ohm and 1.2ohm Mesh Coil to deliver outstanding flavor from your favorite e-juice or nicotine salt. Equipped with a 1000mAh rechargeable battery, the LUXE Q does not feature any buttons or screens to save power, relying on a draw-activated firing mechanism and tri-colored LED indicator light, instead.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/Vaporesso_Luxe_Q_Infographic.jpg?v=1633049180\" alt=\"vaporesso luxe q pod system infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/Vaporesso_Luxe_Q_Infographic.jpg?v=1633049180\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 91.8mm by 26mm by 16.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1000mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntelligent Pod Recognition\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3-Color LED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow System - 